{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2022-09-13 13:00:00', 'title': 'SOCALGAS AND LANDI RENZO USA CONVERT 200 ADDITIONAL FIELD SERVICE TRUCKS TO RUN ON RENEWABLE NATURAL GAS', 'text': "APPROXIMATELY 44% OF THE UTILITY'S FLEET WILL RUN ON CLEAN FUELS LOS ANGELES , SEPT. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA GAS CO. (SOCALGAS) TODAY ANNOUNCED AN ADDITIONAL MULTI-MILLION-DOLLAR COLLABORATION WITH LANDI RENZO USA FOR 200 NEW FORD F-250 SERVICE PICKUP TRUCKS TO JOIN THE UTILITIES FLEET."}